14.
Failure to come forward for penalization of unauthorized constructions.
- Where an application for regulating and penalizing the unauthorizedly constructed building has not been made as per
rule 3,
(a)
such unauthorized constructions would be treated as continuing offence and penalty as per Law would be levied;
(b)
Other enforcement action including demolition shall be initiated by the competent authority as per law;
(c)
No further building approvals shall be considered by the building sanctioning authority in the said site;
(d)
The builder/developer responsible for constructing the building unauthorisedly or in deviation to the sanctioned plans
shall be blacklisted;
